y and create a supportive network around your music, which could lead to exciting collaborations and new projects.\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\", \"id\": \"answer\", \"time_scope\": null}, {\"description\": \"What are my current music-related activities or hobbies?\", \"id\": \"subtask_current_music_activities\", \"time_scope\": null}]"
